# Deploy only the marketing site. Vercel falls back to .gitignore when this
# file is absent, but relying on that is fragile — an explicit list keeps
# unrelated projects and local business documents out of the deployment.

# Separate OSINT app (own Flask/Android project, ~113MB, and a local
# config.py holding plaintext API keys). Deploys on its own to Render.
/Recon-main/

# Local business documents, never web content.
*.xlsx

# Local tooling and build leftovers.
/.claude/
*.tsbuildinfo
